[{"id":2765180124,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6k0Uzc","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally on all 3D demos from godot-demo-projects at 20 TPS, it works as expected on those demos.\r\n\r\nHowever, on the TPS demo, this causes graphical glitches with shadows not present on `master` with the PR's commit locally reverted:\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a49476dd-08a2-4845-86e2-3345e2e5e066)\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c5d6484-cbbf-4805-a73f-bf22f035b1fa)\r\n\r\nThere are many clustering artifacts and shadow maps have missing elements in them.\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269#pullrequestreview-2765180124","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104269","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-14T18:09:20Z"},{"id":2769219530,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lDu_K","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Works great now!\r\n\r\nI noticed one issue with particles interpolation in the TPS demo though (which didn't occur in `master`). When you fire a bullet, the particles will create a streak between a fixed position in the world and the bullet's initial position:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45d8230c-c184-4900-8981-65feba38b696\r\n\r\nThis may be a game code issue that's highlighted by the PR, but it didn't happen before (I've double-checked it).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269#pullrequestreview-2769219530","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104269","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-15T17:20:07Z"},{"id":2778274401,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lmRph","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested again on TPS demo, 3D platformer and Truck Town, it works as expected. The particle streaking issue is fixed.\r\n\r\nCamera FOV is now interpolated in Truck Town as well. Here's what it looks like at 10 TPS:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b9b7ba6-8a16-4ba0-a5db-00399aca745c\r\n\r\nThis seems to already be the case in 2D in `master`, but not in 3D. Therefore, this PR now fully addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9964.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269#pullrequestreview-2778274401","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104269","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-18T10:26:46Z"},{"id":2763914683,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6kvf27","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269#pullrequestreview-2763914683","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104269","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-26T12:32:12Z"},{"id":2795974800,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mpzCQ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?u=380bea11a30c8cb9a25651d120a4a85904ced8e3&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","login":"rburing","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269#pullrequestreview-2795974800","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104269","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-26T12:42:07Z"},{"id":2795984330,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mp1XK","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:0